# Line endings must not be rewritten on checkout.
#
# Every structural anchor in src/pdf/structure.ts is line-anchored, and a
# `\r` left at the end of a line defeats any pattern ending in `$` without the
# multiline flag — src/pdf/structure.ts's `PART` is exactly that, so a CRLF
# checkout silently loses every ΜΕΡΟΣ/ΚΕΦΑΛΑΙΟ heading. test/unit/pdf's
# snapshot reproduction also compares extracted text to these files byte for
# byte. Both reasons make LF part of the fixtures, not a preference.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
